   ],
   "id": "e8",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.68,
      294.72,
      254.4,
      303.84
     ],
     "text": "In addition to evidence of distinctness and stability, the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      305.76,
      254.4,
      314.4
     ],
     "text": "applicant has submitted photographic prints of the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      316.8,
      255.36,
      325.44
     ],
     "text": "results of SDS-polyacrylamide gel electrophoresis of"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.72,
      327.36,
      254.4,
      336.0
     ],
     "text": "extracted seed protcins. These demonstrate a difference"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      338.4,
      254.4,
      347.04
     ],
     "text": "in banding pattern between the varieties analysed and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.72,
      348.96,
      254.4,
      358.08
     ],
     "text": "consistency between the two samples of \u201cJackaroo\u2019. The"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.72,
      360.0,
      253.92,
      368.64
     ],
     "text": "analytical method used is essentially as described in"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.72,
      369.12,
      254.4,
      382.08
     ],
     "text": "Gardiner, SE and Forde MB (1987), Seed Science and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.72,
      382.56,
      254.4,
      390.72
     ],
     "text": "Technology /5, 663-674, modified by the use of the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.72,
      393.6,
      254.4,
      401.76
     ],
     "text": "extraction medium described by Smith, DB and Payne,"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      404.64,
      254.4,
      413.28
     ],
     "text": "PI (1984), J. natn. Inst. agric. Bot. /6,487-498. The"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      415.2,
      254.4,
      423.84
     ],
     "text": "method is fully described in \u2018Identification of cultivars"
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "In addition to evidence of distinctness and stability, the\napplicant has submitted photographic prints of the\nresults of SDS-polyacrylamide gel electrophoresis of\nextracted seed protcins. These demonstrate a difference\nin banding pattern between the varieties analysed and\nconsistency between the two samples of \u201cJackaroo\u2019. The\nanalytical method used is essentially as described in\nGardiner, SE and Forde MB (1987), Seed Science and\nTechnology /5, 663-674, modified by the use of the\nextraction medium described by Smith, DB and Payne,\nPI (1984), J. natn. Inst. agric. Bot. /6,487-498. The\nmethod is fully described in \u2018Identification of cultivars",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
